sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant UI as Login Page
    participant NextAuth as NextAuth Credentials
    participant API as /api/auth/[...nextauth]
    participant DB as PostgreSQL (Supabase)
    participant JWT as JWT Session

    User->>UI: Enter email + password and submit
    UI->>NextAuth: signIn("credentials", { email, password, remember })
    NextAuth->>API: POST credentials request
    API->>API: Validate payload (loginSchema)

    alt Invalid payload
        API-->>UI: error (validation / unauthorized)
        UI-->>User: Show login error
    else Valid payload
        API->>DB: Find user by email
        DB-->>API: User row + password hash
        API->>API: bcrypt.compare(password, hash)

        alt Invalid user or password
            API-->>UI: 401 Invalid email or password
            UI-->>User: Show error message
        else Valid credentials
            API->>JWT: Issue/refresh JWT session
            JWT-->>API: Session token
            API-->>UI: Success response
            UI-->>User: Redirect to /dashboard
        end
    end
